        <div type="layout" source="#source-14081-14421" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-14128-14379"><seg source="#source-14128-14143">○遠野郷の</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-14143-14179" corresp="#source-14149-14179"><seg source="#source-14143-14149">トー</seg></hi><seg source="#source-14179-14188">はもと</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-14188-14230" corresp="#source-14197-14230"><seg source="#source-14188-14197">アイヌ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-14230-14284">語の湖という語より出でたるなるべし、</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-14284-14320" corresp="#source-14290-14320"><seg source="#source-14284-14290">ナイ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-14320-14323">も</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-14323-14365" corresp="#source-14332-14365"><seg source="#source-14323-14332">アイヌ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-14365-14379">語なり。</seg></p>
